      </div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p>You&#039;ll graduate with the ability to configure and defend a network, while also understanding the risk, policy, and compliance side well enough to communicate effectively with company leadership.  Employers need both, so that&#039;s what we prepare you for.</p>
</div>
      
